      "title": "Suchika Tariyal reaches semifinal in mixed martial art to book India's first Asian Games medal",
      "description": "India secured its first medal at the Aichi-Nagoya Asian Games after Suchika Tariyal defeated Mongolia’s Altanchimeg Baigalmaa to reach the women’s traditional 60kg MMA semifinal. India’s women’s table tennis team also opened its campaign with a 3-0 win over I…",
